            Directly from you
            Schools, colleges, universities or other education organisations
            Publicly available sources
            How long we keep information
            [Paste your retention schedule here.]
            
        </p>
        <p>

            For more information on how long we store your personal information or the criteria we use to determine this please contact us using the details provided above.
            
        </p>

        <h5>Our Retention schedule</h5>
        <p>
            Every year our event data is removed from public view (unless a separate agreement has been made with the event owner), and any data collected is cleared within 2 years from date of recipt. 
        </p>
        
        <p>

            
            How to complain
            If you have any concerns about our use of your personal data, you can make a complaint to us using the contact details at the top of this privacy notice.
            
        </p>
        <p>
        If you remain unhappy with how we’ve used your data after raising a complaint with us, you can also complain to the ICO.
            
